Subject: [PATCH 15/15] test(desktop): platformize lock/concurrency/monitor
 tests (CI evidence-based)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- protected_field 锁语义用例 win32 skipif（flock 无等价物，文档化 no-op）
- folder_visibility 并发用例 win32 skipif + 断言 set 化（Windows 无互斥锁会丢记录）
- system_monitor: getloadavg patch raising=False + linux 用例 skipif
- aggregation manifest 键测试侧归一化（生产修复后为幂等 no-op）

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
